  m_text: 'The comments are a storm of denial, prayers, and wild conspiracies. One post catches your eye: a traffic map showing military checkpoints. <color=#F59E0B><i>They are barricading the bridges out of the city.</i></color>


    Before you can scroll further, the little loading icon freezes. The signal drops completely. The internet is gone.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 1951727070}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 1213352585}
  m_fontSharedMaterials: []
  m_fontMaterial: {fileID: 0}
